<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Thursday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK			  RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			     3-mths	  6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	 11.75 /11.50  12.20 /12.05   12.75 /12.55</p>
<p>BPI			 11.60 /11.50  12.15 /12.05   12.65 /12.575</p>
<p>Citibank		  11.70 /11.60  12.375/12.15   12.70 /12.60</p>
<p>Metrobank		 11.70 /11.55  12.25 /12.00   12.75 /12.45</p>
<p>Multinational	   11.70 /11.50  12.30 /12.125  12.70 /12.50</p>
<p>PNB			 11.60 /11.50  12.125/11.95   12.65 /12.50</p>
<p>StanChart		 11.55 /11.45  12.15 /12.05   12.60 /12.50</p>
<p>Solidbank		 11.70 /11.60  12.25 /12.15   12.65 /12.55</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
